# DUSKLING: 42 rooms, every one well formed (one way in, a way on or an
# egg, warps only where flowers grow). And the secrets are needed: from
# beside the hidden spring under the amber egg, and beside the one under
# the glowworm grotto's warp within the warp, the route finder finds the
# way with the springs, and none when springs are turned into plain blocks.
game duskling
wait 5
expect room_errors == 0
cheat room 28
cheat no_foes
cheat pos 1500 141
wait 10
cheat nerf 4
cheat solvehere 4 4000
expect solve_ok == 0
cheat room 28
cheat no_foes
cheat pos 1500 141
wait 10
cheat nerf 0
cheat solvehere 4 4000
expect solve_ok == 1
cheat room 22
cheat no_foes
cheat pos 1760 141
wait 10
cheat nerf 4
cheat solvehere 1 4000
expect solve_ok == 0
cheat room 22
cheat no_foes
cheat pos 1760 141
wait 10
cheat nerf 0
cheat solvehere 1 4000
expect solve_ok == 1
